    <item>
      <title>From: Chas. Morgan, To: Bess Chandler</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/1911/01/28/498/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 28 Jan 1911 22:21:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/1911/01/28/498/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18403714_0158.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140430_18403714_0158&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18403714_0158.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18404455_0159.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140430_18404455_0159&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18404455_0159.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;From: Chas. Morgan, To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Pleasantville, Illinois on January 28, 1911&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello Bess,&lt;br&gt;
How are you? Have not heard from you for ages. Why don’t you write?&lt;br&gt;
Chas.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
